        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion E-W2, Stainless Steel Von Braun Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern design of the Von Braun Stainless Steel Entryset is accentuated through the very contemporary material. This modern door handle is available in either brushed stainless steel or polished stainless steel.  The Von Braun Entryset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-von-braun-handleset-fusion-w2\"><b>Matching Von Braun Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Von Braun Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion E-W2 Von Braun Modern Front Door Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2 on center door boring</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</B>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the latch underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob on both the inside and the outside.\r\n</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Von Braun Entryset, Fusion E-W2",
                "description": "Fusion E-W2, Von Braun Entryset -- The modern design of the Von Braun Stainless Steel Entryset is accentuated through the very contemporary material. This modern door handle is available in either brushed stainless steel or polished stainless steel.  The Von Braun Entryset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
